# Deploy to phone

After finishing Android app code changes (features, fixes, UI), always:

1. Build and install: `.\gradlew :app:installDebug`
2. Launch on the connected device via adb:
   - adb: `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Android\Sdk\platform-tools\adb.exe` (not always on PATH)
   - package / activity: `com.asinosoft.photogallery/.MainActivity`
   - command: `& "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\Android\Sdk\platform-tools\adb.exe" shell am start -n com.asinosoft.photogallery/.MainActivity`
3. Do this without waiting to be asked.
4. If no device is connected, say so briefly and stop — don't only compile.
